    "同意しなくても、作ったアプリの閲覧・記録はできます。AI を使う機能だけが使えません。同意は設定からいつでも取り消せます(送信済みの内容は取り消せません)。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without consent you can still view and record in your apps; only AI features are unavailable. You can withdraw consent in Settings at any time (data already sent cannot be recalled)."
          }
        },
